CHANGE USER PASSWORDS including local account on DC


1. Active Directory Users and Computers (GUI)
This is the standard method for most admins.

Open Active Directory Users and Computers (dsa.msc).

Locate the user in their respective Organizational Unit (OU).

Right-click the user and select Reset Password....

Enter the new password and confirm it.

Optional: Check "User must change password at next logon" (Note: This will not work if "Smart Card is Required" is enabled, as the user won't be able to provide a "current" password they don't know).



